#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them when they continued, and the guide led them by the coastal way. The guide’s personal name and the precise route are not established here."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah dan penunjuk jalan pergi bersama mereka apabila mereka meneruskan perjalanan, dan penunjuk jalan membawa mereka melalui jalan pesisir pantai. Nama peribadi penunjuk jalan dan laluan yang tepat tidak ditetapkan di sini."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them after darkness and returned to Makkah before daybreak."
msgstr "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr membawa berita tentang rancangan jahat terhadap mereka selepas hari gelap dan kembali ke Makkah sebelum fajar."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah tended the flock and brought milk near the cave during the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah menggembala kambing dan membawa susu ke dekat gua sepanjang tiga malam tersebut."

