#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah provided another kind of help. He tended sheep and brought them near after nightfall, making milk available. The account describes this on each of the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah memberikan bantuan dalam bentuk lain. Beliau menggembala kambing dan membawanya mendekati mereka selepas malam gelap, lalu menyediakan susu. Riwayat tersebut menceritakan perkara ini pada setiap malam daripada ketiga-tiga malam itu."

