#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "In Ibn Ishaq’s account, “as it reached me,” ‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah had left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, knowing his honesty; the report says ‘Ali was to return their deposits."
msgstr "Dalam riwayat Ibn Ishaq, dengan ungkapan “seperti yang sampai kepadaku”, Ali tinggal di belakang atas satu lagi sebab. Penduduk Makkah menitipkan harta mereka kepada Nabi ﷺ kerana mereka mengenali sifat amanah baginda; menurut riwayat itu, Ali akan memulangkan barang titipan mereka."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She said they had no food and no milk-giving ewe."
msgstr "Kemudian, dalam perjalanan, mereka singgah di khemah Umm Ma‘bad daripada Khuza‘ah dan meminta layanan. Beliau berkata bahawa mereka tiada makanan dan tiada biri-biri betina yang mengeluarkan susu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "The report says the Prophet ﷺ called for one of her sheep, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Menurut riwayat itu, Nabi ﷺ meminta seekor daripada biri-biri miliknya, mengusap ambingnya dengan tangan baginda dan berdoa kepada Allah. Baginda memerah susunya ke dalam bekas besar hingga berbuih, lalu berkata: “Minumlah, wahai Umm Ma‘bad.” Ibn Kathir menyebut bahawa kisahnya terkenal dan diriwayatkan melalui jalur-jalur yang saling menguatkan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "According to ‘Urwa, he stayed among them for a few more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Menurut riwayat ‘Urwa, baginda tinggal bersama mereka selama beberapa malam melebihi sepuluh malam. Di situ baginda mendirikan masjid yang menurut riwayat didirikan atas dasar takwa, lalu bersolat di dalamnya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She said they had no food or milk-giving ewe; the report then describes milk from one of her sheep."
msgstr "Mereka singgah di khemah Umm Ma‘bad. Beliau berkata bahawa mereka tiada makanan atau biri-biri betina yang mengeluarkan susu; kemudian riwayat itu menceritakan pemerahan susu daripada seekor biri-biri miliknya."

