#: src/content/text.generated.js
msgid "The searchers came close, so close that Abu Bakr whispered, “If one of them looked down at his feet, he would see us.” The Prophet ﷺ answered, “What do you think of two, when Allah is their third?”"
msgstr "Para pencari itu datang begitu dekat, sehingga Abu Bakr berbisik, “Jika salah seorang daripada mereka melihat ke bawah, ke arah kakinya, dia akan nampak kita.” Nabi ﷺ menjawab, “Bagaimana pendapatmu tentang dua orang yang Allah menjadi yang ketiga bersama mereka?”"

#: src/content/text.generated.js
msgid "Nor were they alone. Each night Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came after dark with whatever Quraysh were plotting, then slipped back before dawn, so that morning found him in Makkah as if he had never left."
msgstr "Mereka juga tidak bersendirian. Setiap malam selepas hari gelap, anak Abu Bakr, ‘Abdullah, datang membawa berita tentang apa sahaja yang dirancang Quraysh, kemudian menyelinap pulang sebelum fajar, sehingga apabila pagi menjelma, dia berada di Makkah seolah-olah tidak pernah pergi."
